# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-9), L §5.14.1: `next` is cut; the next movement of a kind is `first(m in K over d ..)
# ties by m.day`. `next` is a plain id again, and no item has it.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: next(transfers, 2026-01-01)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME unknown id next (m.tally:17)
